    <string name="oem_steps_transsion">Fungua Phone Master, kisha Power Manager.\nGusa Auto-start management na uruhusu Hesabu.\nKatika Mipangilio, Programu, Hesabu, Betri, chagua Bila kizuizi.</string>
    <string name="oem_steps_xiaomi">Fungua Mipangilio, Programu, Dhibiti programu, Hesabu.\nWasha Autostart.\nChini ya Kiokoa betri chagua Bila vizuizi.\nKatika Usalama, Boost speed, Lock apps, funga Hesabu isifutwe.</string>
    <string name="oem_steps_oppo">Fungua Mipangilio, Betri, Mipangilio zaidi.\nRuhusu Hesabu kufanya kazi kwa nyuma na kujianzisha.\nKatika Mipangilio, Programu, Hesabu, Matumizi ya betri, ruhusu shughuli za nyuma.</string>
    <string name="oem_steps_vivo">Fungua i Manager, App manager, Autostart manager na uruhusu Hesabu.\nKatika Mipangilio, Betri, Background power consumption management, ruhusu Hesabu.</string>
    <string name="oem_steps_huawei">Fungua Mipangilio, Betri, App launch.\nZima usimamizi wa kiotomatiki kwa Hesabu na uruhusu Auto-launch, Secondary launch na Run in background.</string>
    <string name="oem_steps_samsung">Fungua Mipangilio, Programu, Hesabu, Betri.\nChagua Bila kizuizi.\nKatika Mipangilio, Betri, Background usage limits, hakikisha Hesabu si programu inayolala.</string>
    <string name="oem_steps_other">Fungua Mipangilio, Programu, Hesabu, Betri.\nChagua Bila kizuizi au ruhusu shughuli za nyuma.</string>

